<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aurelia | Timeless Brilliance</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* --- CSS STYLES --- */
        :root {
            --cream: #faf8f5;
            --gold: #b88a44;
            --dark: #2c2c2c;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--dark); }

        /* Top Bar & Nav */
        .top-bar { background: var(--cream); text-align: center; padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 5%; background: var(--white); border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 25px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 500; }
        .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--dark); }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        
        /* Hero Section */
        .hero { display: flex; height: 80vh; background: var(--white); }
        .hero-text { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 5% 10%; }
        .hero-text h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero-text h1 span { color: var(--gold); font-style: italic; }
        .hero-text p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px; max-width: 400px; color: #666; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--gold); color: var(--white); padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; transition: 0.3s; border: none; cursor: pointer; width: fit-content; }
        .btn:hover { background: #9d7336; }
        .hero-img { flex: 1; background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599643478514-4a4204b4a0df?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover; }

        /* Categories */
        .categories { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; padding: 40px 5%; background: var(--white); text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .category { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; }
        .category:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        /* Products */
        .section-title { text-align: center; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 32px; margin: 60px 0 40px; }
        .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding: 0 5%; margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .product { text-align: center; background: var(--white); padding: 20px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .product:hover { box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .product img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .product h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .product p { color: var(--gold); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }

        /* Footer */
        footer { background: var(--dark); color: var(--white); text-align: center; padding: 40px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="top-bar">COMPLIMENTARY INSURED SHIPPING ON ALL ORDERS | ETHICAL LUXURY, BEAUTIFULLY CRAFTED.</div>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Aurelia</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#">NEW IN</a>
            <a href="#">COLLECTIONS</a>
            <a href="#">JEWELRY</a>
            <a href="#">BRIDAL</a>
            <a href="#">GIFTS</a>
            <a href="#">ABOUT US</a>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 18px;">🛒</div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <p style="color: var(--gold); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px;">— THE ART OF ADORNMENT</p>
            <h1>Timeless<br><span>Brilliance</span></h1>
            <p>Exquisite designs, masterfully crafted for life's most meaningful moments.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn">Discover Signature Pieces &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-img"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="categories">
        <div class="category">Rings</div>
        <div class="category">Necklaces</div>
        <div class="category">Earrings</div>
        <div class="category">Bracelets</div>
        <div class="category">Bridal Collection</div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">Loved Most</h2>
    <section class="product-grid">
        <div class="product">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100804763-247f67b2548e?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Ring">
            <h3>Luminous Solitaire Ring</h3>
            <p>$1,890</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599643477877-530eb83abc8e?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Necklace">
            <h3>Celeste Diamond Pendant</h3>
            <p>$2,450</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535632066927-ab7c9ab60908?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Earrings">
            <h3>Pearl Drop Earrings</h3>
            <p>$1,350</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603561591411-07134e71a2a9?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Bracelet">
            <h3>Venetian Link Bracelet</h3>
            <p>$1,680</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 AURELIA JEWELRY. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
